1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730
Good morning, how can I help you?

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:09,170
Good morning. Umm, I understand you help fix up students with host families.

3
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,380
That's right... are you interested in...?

4
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:12,900
Yes...

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,670
Well please sit down and I'll just take a few details.

6
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,660
Thank you.

7
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:20,560
Right now, what name is it?

8
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,830
Jenny Chan.

9
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,650
Can you spell that please?

10
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:31,840
Yes... J-E-N-N-Y C-H-A-N.

11
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,870
Right... and what is your present address?

12
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:39,200
Sea View Guest House, 14 Hill Road.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,650
OK, and do you know the phone number there?

14
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:55,740
Yes... I have it here, ummm... 2237676, but I'm only there after about 7 pm.

15
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,720
So when would be the best time to catch you?

16
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:07,000
I suppose between 9 and let me see. half-past, before I leave for the college.

17
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,840
Great... and can I ask you your age?

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,560
I've just had my nineteenth birthday.

19
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:17,250
And how long would you want to stay with the host family?

20
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:19,840
I'm planning on staying a year

21
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:23,658
but at the moment I'm definitely here for four months only.

22
00:01:23,658 --> 00:01:27,050
I have to get an extension to my permit.

23
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:29,520
You're working on it? Fine

24
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,720
and what will be your occupation while you're in the UK?

25
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,600
Studying English?

26
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:38,710
And what would you say your level of English is?

27
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:44,833
Umm. Good, I think I'd like to say 'advanced'

28
00:01:45,094 --> 00:01:49,150
but my written work is below the level of my spoken

29
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:51,760
so I suppose it's intermediate.

30
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:54,420
Certainly your spoken English is advanced

31
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:57,940
Anyway, which area do you think you would prefer?

32
00:01:57,940 --> 00:02:06,180
Ummm, well I'm studying right in the centre but I'd really like to live in the north-west.

33
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:13,950
That shouldn't be a great problem... we usually have lots of families up there.

34
00:02:13,950 --> 00:02:17,240
And do you have any particular requirements for diet?

35
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:21,560
Well, I'm nearly a vegetarian... not quite.

36
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:25,110
Shall I say you are? It's probably easier that way.

37
00:02:25,110 --> 00:02:26,170
That would be best.

38
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:28,830
Anything about your actual room?

39
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:33,545
I would prefer my own facilities-en suite', is that right?

40
00:02:33,545 --> 00:02:38,940
And also if it's possible a TV

41
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:44,390
and I'd also like the house to have a real garden rather than just a yard,

42
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:47,690
somewhere I could sit and be peaceful.

43
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:48,730
Is that all?

44
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:54,240
Well... I'm really serious about improving my English

45
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:58,890
so I'd prefer to be the only guest if that's possible?

46
00:02:58,890 --> 00:03:02,530
No other guests... Yes, you get more practice that way.

47
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:08,080
Anyway, obviously all this is partly dependent on how much you're willing to pay

48
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,810
What did you have in mind?

49
00:03:09,810 --> 00:03:15,220
I was thinking in terms of about £60-£80 a week

50
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:18,870
but I'd go up to a hundred if it was something special.

51
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:22,500
Well I don't think we'd have any problems finding something for you.

52
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,680
Oh, good.

53
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,760
And when would you want it for?

54
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:29,940
I'd like to move in approximately two weeks.

55
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:38,280
Let me see, it's the 10th today... so if we go for the Monday it's the 23rd March.

56
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,030
Yes.

57
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:44,260
Right... good, and if I could ask one last question...
